---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card
  colSpan="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"
  rowSpan="lg:row-span-6"
  title="About Me"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p></p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      I'm a software engineer who fell for the unglamorous half of the job: making sure the thing actually works. I write end to end and API tests, wire up CI that catches regressions before anyone else does, and replace the "did someone check this?" ritual with something that just runs.
    </p>
    <p></p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      I still ship features, and honestly that's the point. Building something and then trying my hardest to break it has made me better at both.
    </p>
    <p></p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      When I'm not doing that, I'm probably somewhere new with a camera, poking around a city I've never been to. I like learning things I'm bad at, and I like working with people who feel the same way.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
